<script setup>
defineProps({feedback:Object,stale:Boolean,busy:Boolean,canAsk:Boolean,unsaved:Boolean,readOnly:Boolean})
const emit=defineEmits(['ask','reload'])
</script>
<template><section class="studio-feedback"><div class="section-title"><h2>AI 回饋</h2><span class="status-badge">文字回饋 · 不計分</span></div><p class="field-hint">AI 可能出錯，請核對案例原文。正式提交後，教師／助教可查看該版本作答與對應回饋。</p><button v-if="!readOnly" class="button primary" :disabled="!canAsk || busy" @click="emit('ask')">{{busy?'AI 回饋處理中…':feedback?.status==='failed'?'重試 AI 回饋':'取得 AI 文字回饋'}}</button><p v-if="unsaved" class="submission-notice">此階段有未儲存修改，請先儲存再取得同一版本的回饋。</p><p v-if="busy || feedback?.status==='pending'" role="status">AI 正在分析已儲存版本，草稿仍可儲存。若重新載入後持續未完成，請稍後重試。</p><template v-if="feedback"><p v-if="stale" class="submission-notice">這是較早版本的回饋，請勿套用到目前未儲存的修改。</p><div v-if="feedback.status==='failed'" class="error-box" role="alert"><strong>S3a · {{feedback.errorCode==='timeout'?'回饋逾時':'回饋暫時無法完成'}}</strong><p>已儲存答案仍保留。你可以重試、繼續修改，或直接正式提交；不必等待 AI。</p><button v-if="!readOnly" class="text-button" @click="emit('reload')">重新載入回饋狀態</button></div><div v-if="feedback.content" :class="{'outdated-feedback':stale}"><h3>整體回饋</h3><p>{{feedback.content.summary}}</p><h3>有證據支持的分析</h3><article v-for="(point,i) in feedback.content.supportedPoints" :key="i"><strong>{{point.point}}</strong><blockquote>{{point.evidence}}</blockquote></article><p v-if="!feedback.content.supportedPoints.length" class="muted">目前沒有列出可核實的支持點。</p><h3>可修訂之處</h3><article v-for="(point,i) in feedback.content.improvements" :key="i"><strong>{{point.point}}</strong><p v-if="point.evidence">案例依據：{{point.evidence}}</p><p>{{point.suggestion}}</p></article><h3>下一步</h3><ul><li v-for="(step,i) in feedback.content.nextSteps" :key="i">{{step}}</li></ul></div></template><p v-else-if="!busy" class="empty-inline">儲存作答後，可以請 AI 提供文字回饋。</p></section></template>
